      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bawcomville%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "After the 1803 Louisiana Purchase, European‑American settlers began arriving in the Ouachita Parish area that would become Bawcomville.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/bawcomville_louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "By the mid‑19th century, Bawcomville’s surrounding farms shipped produce to New Orleans via steamboats on the Ouachita River.",
